# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Hemp storefront — a Shopify theme developed with the Shopify CLI.
#  Third-party things and machine-local things stay out of the repo.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Dependencies.
node_modules/

# ── Shopify CLI state ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# `.shopify/` is the CLI's own scratch directory: which store it last talked to,
# the development theme id, cached session. Machine-local, never shared.
.shopify/

# `shopify theme package` writes its uploadable archive here.
*.zip

# The Admin API token minted by scripts/admin.mjs, with its expiry beside it.
.shopify-admin-token

# ── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# `.env` may hold a Theme Access password when one is used locally.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Tooling / OS noise ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
pnpm-debug.log*
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.code-workspace

# Python scratch used by skincare-commercial/ (the old-site scrape).
.venv/
__pycache__/
